hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1067","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Bani Zamra ke aik shakhs se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aqeeqa ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke main uqooq ko pasand nahi karta. Aur goya Aap ne sirf naam ko napasand kya aur farmaya ke jis ke yahan bacha paida ho aur wo apne bache ki taraf se qurbani karna chahe to kare."
"1068","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Jafar bin Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti Fatima ne Hasan aur Husain aur Zainab aur Umm Kulsoom ke baal wazan kiye aur us ke wazan ke barabar chandi sadqa ki."
"1069","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti Fatima ne Hasan aur Husain ke baal wazan kiye aur us ke wazan ke barabar chandi sadqa ki."
"1070","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar se un ke ghar walon mein se jo bhi aqeeqa mangta use wo use de dete they, aur wo apni aulad ki taraf se aqeeqa karte they, nar aur mada mein se har aik ki taraf se bakri bakri."
"1071","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine apne walid ko aqeeqa mustahab samajhte suna, chahe chirya se ho."
"1072","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib ke do beton Hasan aur Husain ki taraf se aqeeqa kya gaya."
"1073","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid Urwa bin Zubair apne beton ki taraf se aqeeqa karte they, nar aur mada mein se har aik ki taraf se bakri bakri. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek aqeeqa mein hukm ye hai ke jo aqeeqa kare to wo apni aulad ki taraf se bakri bakri aqeeqa kare, nar aur mada, aur aqeeqa wajib nahi lekin is par amal mustahab hai aur ye us hukm mein se hai jis par log hamare nazdeek hamesha se hain, phir jo apni aulad ki taraf se aqeeqa kare to wo qurbani aur zabiha ke manzilay mein hai, is mein kana, laghar, toota hua ya beemar jaiz nahi, aur is ke gosht mein se kuchh becha na jaye aur na is ki khaal, aur is ki haddiyan tori jain, aur is ke ghar wale is ke gosht mein se khain aur is mein se sadqa karein, aur bache ko is ke khoon mein se kuchh na lagaya jaye."
